   "texto": [
    "**Fjord** is a narrow sea arm often surrounded by mountains; **innsjø** is an inner lake. **Elv** is river and **dal**, valley.",
    "**Skog** means forest. In Bokmål, its defined forms are **skogen**, **elva**, **dalen** and **fjorden**; it notes that the articles are glued to the end of the noun."
